OL,4,CSouthport survivors' parents           
OL,5,C'disgusted' by school recovery funding 
OL,6,GParents of children injured in the     
OL,7,GSouthport knife attack have criticised 
OL,8,G"huge discrepancies" in support money  
OL,9,Ggiven to schools in the area after the 
OL,10,Gstabbing.                              
OL,12,FSchools attended by 10 of the          
OL,13,Fsurvivors received more than a million 
OL,14,Fpounds in recovery funding between     
OL,15,Fthem, while schools attended by 13     
OL,16,Fother survivors received no direct     
OL,17,Ffunding, the families' lawyers have    
OL,18,Fsaid.                                  
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
