OL,4,CFertility policy change a 'priority',  
OL,5,Csays NHS care board                    
OL,6,GHealth bosses have announced a review  
OL,7,Gof fertility services in Lancashire    
OL,8,Gand South Cumbria amid calls for more  
OL,9,GNHS-funded IVF treatment.              
OL,11,FNHS Lancashire and South Cumbria       
OL,12,FIntegrated Care Board (ICB) said it    
OL,13,Fwould review a number of its           
OL,14,Fcommissioning policies, with assisted  
OL,15,Fconception services among its          
OL,16,Fpriorities.                            
OL,18,FRibble Valley councillor Michael       
OL,19,FGraveston said the one-cycle IVF limit 
OL,20,Fhad been "heartbreaking" for him and   
OL,21,Fhis wife, Joanne.                      
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
