OL,4,CTown's #200m rebuild fund switches to  
OL,5,Cnew company                            
OL,6,GControl of a #200m fund to regenerate  
OL,7,Ga town deemed vital to national        
OL,8,Gsecurity has moved to a limited        
OL,9,Gcompany owned by the government.       
OL,11,FThe 10-year plan for Barrow-in-Furness 
OL,12,Fin Cumbria aims to make the town a     
OL,13,Fmore attractive place to live and      
OL,14,Fsupport work on the UK's nuclear-armed 
OL,15,Fsubmarines.                            
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
